{"id":"81e99b41571ec995","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-elementary-substructure.md","title":"Elementary substructure (legacy)","display":"df-elementary-substructure — Elementary substructure (legacy)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-elementary-substructure","aliases":["27-df-elementary-substructure"],"display":"df-elementary-substructure — Elementary substructure (legacy)","depends_on":["[[27-df-structure]]","[[27-df-formula]]","[[27-df-assignment]]","[[27-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-elementary-substructure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-elementary-substructure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-substructure — Elementary substructure (legacy)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea25e09b331cbbdb\" href=\"?note=ea25e09b331cbbdb\" title=\"27-df-structure\">27-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" href=\"?note=1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" title=\"27-df-formula\">27-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ab26a4ec0de4af8\" href=\"?note=9ab26a4ec0de4af8\" title=\"27-df-assignment\">27-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6\" href=\"?note=fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6\" title=\"27-df-satisfaction\">27-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S),\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S),\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>；分区和解释见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ea25e09b331cbbdb\" href=\"?note=ea25e09b331cbbdb\" title=\"27-df-structure\">27-df-structure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" href=\"?note=1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" title=\"27-df-formula\">27-df-formula</a>；赋值与满足见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9ab26a4ec0de4af8\" href=\"?note=9ab26a4ec0de4af8\" title=\"27-df-assignment\">27-df-assignment</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6\" href=\"?note=fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6\" title=\"27-df-satisfaction\">27-df-satisfaction</a>。引入同签名子结构关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq_S\">\\(\\subseteq_S\\)</span>、初等子结构关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq_S\">\\(\\preccurlyeq_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\subseteq\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\subseteq\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 在本原子仅为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_S\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_S\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 的局部别名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_S\\mathfrak A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ B\\subseteq A\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\;(c^{\\mathfrak B}=c^{\\mathfrak A})\\land\\forall m\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_m(S)\\;(f^{\\mathfrak B}=f^{\\mathfrak A}\\upharpoonright B^m)\\land\\forall m\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S)\\;(R^{\\mathfrak B}=R^{\\mathfrak A}\\cap B^m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_S\\mathfrak A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ B\\subseteq A\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\;(c^{\\mathfrak B}=c^{\\mathfrak A})\\land\\forall m\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_m(S)\\;(f^{\\mathfrak B}=f^{\\mathfrak A}\\upharpoonright B^m)\\land\\forall m\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S)\\;(R^{\\mathfrak B}=R^{\\mathfrak A}\\cap B^m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\subseteq\\mathfrak A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathfrak B\\subseteq_S\\mathfrak A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak B\\subseteq\\mathfrak A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathfrak B\\subseteq_S\\mathfrak A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\preccurlyeq_S\\mathfrak A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathfrak B\\subseteq_S\\mathfrak A\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak B)\\cap\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;(\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak B\\preccurlyeq_S\\mathfrak A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathfrak B\\subseteq_S\\mathfrak A\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak B)\\cap\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;(\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是目录遗留的一阶逻辑背景（legacy background），不是《Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications》的书内对应原子。本次保留其概念接口并修复类型、绑定和依赖；未取得该书的对应定义或页码，不声称依据原书核验。</li>\n<li>已读取 57-df-substructure 的实际 Assertion，局部展开其常量一致、函数限制于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B^m\">\\(B^m\\)</span>、关系诱导条件，消除外部结构表示与本地表示的未说明等同。</li>\n<li>Hypothesis 明确两者为同签名结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq A\">\\(B\\subseteq A\\)</span> 保证对子结构的赋值也能用于环境结构。原初等子结构含义保留。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"ea25e09b331cbbdb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1f9e71c9f1e5764e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9ab26a4ec0de4af8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"ea25e09b331cbbdb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S),\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$；分区和解释见 [[27-df-structure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1f9e71c9f1e5764e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 见 [[27-df-formula]]；赋值与满足见 [[27-df-assignment]]、[[27-df-satisfaction]]。引入同签名子结构关系 $\\subseteq_S$、初等子结构关系 $\\preccurlyeq_S$；$\\mathfrak B\\subseteq\\mathfrak A$ 在本原子仅为 $\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_S\\mathfrak A$ 的局部别名。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9ab26a4ec0de4af8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 见